msgid "Density fitting"
msgstr "密度拟合"

msgid ""
"Density fitting can be used to approximate the integrals in spin restricted "
"Hartree-Fock (``HF``), density functional theory (``KS``), second-order "
"Møller-Plesset perturbation theory (``MP2`` and ``RMP2``), explicitly "
"correlated MP2 (MP2-F12), all levels of closed-shell local correlation "
"methods (``LCC2``, ``LMP2``-``LMP4``, ``LQCISD(T)``, ``LCCSD(T)``), as well "
"as for ``CASSCF`` and ``CASPT2`` methods. Density fitting is invoked by "
"adding the prefix ``DF-`` to the command name, e.g. ``DF-HF``, ``DF-KS``, "
"``DF-MP2`` and so on. Gradients are available for ``DF-HF``, ``DF-KS``, "
"``DF-MP2``, ``DF-LMP2``, ``DF-CASSCF``, and ``DF-CASPT2``. Symmetry is "
"implemented for energy calculations (without gradients) for ``DF-RHF``, "
"``DF-RKS``,\\ ``DF-UHF``, ``DF-UKS`` ``DF-RMP2``,\\ ``DF-RMP2-F12``, ``DF-"
"CASSCF|DF-MULTI``, ``DF-NEVPT2``, ``DF-CASPT2|DF-RS2``, and ``DF-RS2C``, but"
" for ``DF-MP2``, ``DF-CCSD`` (and variants) as well as for local methods "
"symmetry is not implemented and automatically turned off."
msgstr ""
"密度拟合可用于近似计算自旋限制 Hartree-Fock (``HF``)、密度泛函理论 (``KS``)、二阶 Møller-Plesset 微扰理论"
" (``MP2`` 和 ``RMP2``)、显式相关 MP2 (MP2-F12)、所有级别的闭壳层局域相关方法 (``LCC2``\\ 、\\ "
"``LMP2``-``LMP4``\\ 、\\ ``LQCISD(T)``\\ 、\\ ``LCCSD(T)``)，以及 ``CASSCF`` 和 "
"``CASPT2`` 方法中的积分。通过在命令名前添加前缀 ``DF-`` 来调用密度拟合，例如 ``DF-HF``\\ 、\\ ``DF-KS``\\"
" 、\\ ``DF-MP2`` 等。梯度计算可用于 ``DF-HF``\\ 、\\ ``DF-KS``\\ 、\\ ``DF-MP2``\\ 、\\ "
"``DF-LMP2``\\ 、\\ ``DF-CASSCF`` 和 ``DF-CASPT2``\\ 。对于能量计算（无梯度），对称性已为 ``DF-"
"RHF``\\ 、\\ ``DF-RKS``\\ 、\\ ``DF-UHF``\\ 、\\ ``DF-UKS``\\ 、\\ ``DF-RMP2``\\"
" 、\\ ``DF-RMP2-F12``\\ 、\\ ``DF-CASSCF|DF-MULTI``\\ 、\\ ``DF-NEVPT2``\\ 、\\ "
"``DF-CASPT2|DF-RS2`` 和 ``DF-RS2C`` 实现，但对于 ``DF-MP2``\\ 、\\ ``DF-CCSD``\\ "
"（及其变体）以及局域方法，对称性未实现并会自动关闭。"

msgid ""
"By default, a fitting basis set will be chosen automatically that "
"corresponds to the current orbital basis set and is appropriate for the "
"method. For instance, if the orbital basis set is ``VTZ``, the default "
"fitting basis is ``VTZ/JKFIT`` for ``DF-HF`` or ``DF-KS``, and "
"``VTZ/MP2FIT`` for ``DF-MP2``. Other fitting basis sets from the library can"
" be chosen using the ``DF_BASIS`` option, e.g."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，将自动选择与当前轨道基组对应且适合该方法的拟合基组。例如，如果轨道基组是 ``VTZ``\\ ，则对于 ``DF-HF`` 或 ``DF-"
"KS``\\ ，默认拟合基组为 ``VTZ/JKFIT``\\ ，对于 ``DF-MP2``\\ ，则为 ``VTZ/MP2FIT``\\ 。可以使用 "
"``DF_BASIS`` 选项从库中选择其他拟合基组，例如"

msgid ""
"The program then chooses automatically the set which is appropriate for the "
"method. Optionally, the basis type can be appended to the basis name and "
"then this supercedes the default, e.g."
msgstr "然后程序会自动选择适合该方法的基组。可选地，可以将基组类型附加到基组名称后，这将覆盖默认设置，例如"

msgid ""
"where ``MYJKBASIS`` and ``MYMP2BASIS`` are sets defined in a basis block. In"
" this case it is the responsibility of the user to ensure that the basis set"
" is appropriate for the method."
msgstr "其中 ``MYJKBASIS`` 和 ``MYMP2BASIS`` 是在基组块中定义的集合。在这种情况下，用户有责任确保基组适用于该方法。"

msgid ""
"The options specified on a global ``DFIT`` directive are also passed down to"
" procedures. However, if a ``DFIT`` is given within a procedure, the "
"corresponding options are used only in the same procedure and procedures "
"called from it. When the procedure terminates, the options from the previous"
" level are recovered."
msgstr ""
"在全局 ``DFIT`` 指令上指定的选项也会传递给过程。但是，如果 ``DFIT`` "
"在过程内给出，则相应的选项仅在同一过程以及从该过程调用的过程中使用。当过程终止时，将恢复上一级的选项。"

msgid "Options for density fitting"
msgstr "密度拟合的选项"

msgid ""
"The options described in this section have sensible default values and "
"usually do not have to be given. Many options described below have alias "
"names. These can be obtained using"
msgstr "本节描述的选项具有合理的默认值，通常无需指定。下面描述的许多选项都有别名。这些可以通过以下方式获取"

msgid "Options to select the fitting basis sets"
msgstr "选择拟合基组的选项"

msgid ""
"``BASIS`` Basis set for fitting (Default: set corresponding to the orbital "
"basis)"
msgstr "``BASIS`` 用于拟合的基组（默认：与轨道基组对应的集合）"

msgid "``BASIS_COUL`` Basis set for Coulomb fitting (default ``BASIS``)"
msgstr "``BASIS_COUL`` 用于库仑拟合的基组（默认 ``BASIS``\\ ）"

msgid "``BASIS_EXCH`` Basis set for exchange fitting (default ``BASIS``)"
msgstr "``BASIS_EXCH`` 用于交换拟合的基组（默认 ``BASIS``\\ ）"

msgid "``BASIS_MP2`` Fitting basis set for DF-MP2 (default ``BASIS``)"
msgstr "``BASIS_MP2`` 用于 DF-MP2 的拟合基组（默认 ``BASIS``\\ ）"

msgid "``BASIS_CCSD`` Fitting basis set for DF-LCCSD (default ``BASIS``)"
msgstr "``BASIS_CCSD`` 用于 DF-LCCSD 的拟合基组（默认 ``BASIS``\\ ）"

msgid "Screening thresholds"
msgstr "筛选阈值"

msgid ""
"``THRAO`` Threshold for neglecting contracted 3-index integrals in the AO "
"basis (default 1.d-8)."
msgstr "``THRAO`` 在原子轨道基组中忽略收缩三中心积分的阈值（默认 1.d-8）。"

msgid ""
"``THRMO`` Threshold for neglecting half-transformed 3-index integrals "
"(default 1.d-8)."
msgstr "``THRMO`` 忽略半变换三中心积分的阈值（默认 1.d-8）。"

msgid "``THRSW`` Threshold for Schwarz screening (default 1.d-5)."
msgstr "``THRSW`` Schwarz 筛选的阈值（默认 1.d-5）。"

msgid ""
"``THROV`` Threshold for neglecting 2-index integrals in the AO (default "
"1.d-10."
msgstr "``THROV`` 原子轨道中忽略2-指标积分的阈值（默认 1.d-10）。"

msgid ""
"``THRPROD`` Product screening threshold for first half transformation "
"(default 1.d-8)."
msgstr "``THRPROD`` 第一次半变换的乘积筛选阈值（默认 1.d-8）。"

msgid "``_SCF`` Coulomb and exchange fitting in DF-HF/DF-KS"
msgstr "``_SCF`` DF-HF/DF-KS中的库仑和交换拟合"

msgid "``_COUL`` Coulomb fitting in DF-HF/DF-KS"
msgstr "``_COUL`` DF-HF/DF-KS中的库仑拟合"

msgid "``_EXCH`` Exchange fitting in DF-HF/DF-KS"
msgstr "``_EXCH`` DF-HF/DF-KS中的交换拟合"

msgid "``_CPHF`` Coulomb and exchange fitting in CPHF"
msgstr "``_CPHF`` CPHF中的库仑和交换拟合"

msgid "``_SCFGRD`` Coulomb and exchange fitting in DF-HF/DF-KS gradients"
msgstr "``_SCFGRD`` DF-HF/DF-KS梯度中的库仑和交换拟合"

msgid "The default values are the same as for the general thresholds."
msgstr "默认值与通用阈值相同。"

msgid "Further thresholds:"
msgstr "更多阈值："

msgid ""
"``THR2HLF`` Threshold for second-half transformation in exchange fitting "
"(default ``THRAO_SCF``)"
msgstr "``THR2HLF`` 交换拟合中第二半变换的阈值（默认 ``THRAO_SCF``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``THRASM_SCF`` Threshold for local assembly of exchange matrix (default "
"``THRAO_SCF``)"
msgstr "``THRASM_SCF`` 交换矩阵局部组装的阈值（默认 ``THRAO_SCF``\\ ）"

msgid "Parameters to enable local fitting"
msgstr "启用局部拟合的参数"

msgid ""
"Local fitting as described in H.-J. Werner, F. R. Manby, and P. J. Knowles, "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1564816>`__ **118**, 8149 "
"(2003), Polly, H.-J. Werner, F. R. Manby, and Peter J. Knowles, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 (2004), "
"and M. Schütz, H.-J. Werner, R. Lindh and F. R. Manby, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1760747>`__ **121**, 737 (2004) can be "
"activated by setting ``LOCFIT=1``. By default, local fitting is disabled, "
"because under certain circumstances it can lead to unacceptable errors. For "
"instance, local fitting must not be used in counter-poise calculations, "
"since the lack of fitting functions at the dummy atoms can lead to wrong "
"results."
msgstr ""
"如 H.-J. Werner, F. R. Manby, 和 P. J. Knowles 在 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1564816>`__ **118**, 8149 (2003) 中，Polly, "
"H.-J. Werner, F. R. Manby, 和 Peter J. Knowles 在 `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 (2004) "
"中，以及 M. Schütz, H.-J. Werner, R. Lindh 和 F. R. Manby 在 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1760747>`__ **121**, 737 (2004) "
"中描述的局部拟合，可以通过设置 ``LOCFIT=1`` "
"来激活。默认情况下，局部拟合是禁用的，因为在某些情况下它可能导致不可接受的误差。例如，在反演计算中不得使用局部拟合，因为哑原子上缺乏拟合函数可能导致错误的结果。"

msgid ""
"Local fitting can be restricted to certain programs, using the following "
"options:"
msgstr "局部拟合可以限制在特定程序中，使用以下选项："

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT`` If positive, use local fitting in all programs in which it is "
"available (default 0)."
msgstr "``LOCFIT`` 若为正值，则在所有可用的程序中使用局部拟合（默认值为 0）。"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_SCF`` If positive, use local fitting in SCF (default ``LOCFIT``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_SCF`` 若为正值，则在 SCF 中使用局部拟合（默认值为 ``LOCFIT``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_MP2`` If positive, use local fitting in DF-LMP2; 1: use orbital "
"domains; 2: use pair domains (default ``LOCFIT``)"
msgstr ""
"``LOCFIT_MP2`` 若为正值，则在 DF-LMP2 中使用局部拟合；1：使用轨道域；2：使用对域（默认值为 ``LOCFIT``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_F12`` If positive, use local fitting in DF-LMP2-F12 (default "
"``LOCFIT``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_F12`` 若为正值，则在 DF-LMP2-F12 中使用局部拟合（默认值为 ``LOCFIT``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_CCSD`` If positive, use local fitting in DF-LCCSD (default "
"``LOCFIT``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_CCSD`` 若为正值，则在 DF-LCCSD 中使用局部拟合（默认值为 ``LOCFIT``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_2EXT`` If positive, use local fitting in LCCSD 2ext transformation "
"(default ``LOCFIT_CCSD``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_2EXT`` 若为正值，则在 LCCSD 2ext 变换中使用局部拟合（默认值为 ``LOCFIT_CCSD``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_3EXT`` If positive, use local fitting in LCCSD 3ext transformation "
"(default ``LOCFIT_CCSD``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_3EXT`` 若为正值，则在 LCCSD 3ext 变换中使用局部拟合（默认值为 ``LOCFIT_CCSD``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_4EXT`` If positive, use local fitting in LCCSD 4ext transformation "
"(default ``LOCFIT_CCSD``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_4EXT`` 若为正值，则在 LCCSD 4ext 变换中使用局部拟合（默认值为 ``LOCFIT_CCSD``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_CPHF`` If positive, use local fitting in CPHF (default ``LOCFIT``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_CPHF`` 若为正数，在 CPHF 中使用局域拟合（默认 ``LOCFIT``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``LOCFIT_SCFGRD`` If positive, use local fitting in gradient calculations "
"(default ``LOCFIT``)"
msgstr "``LOCFIT_SCFGRD`` 若为正数，在梯度计算中使用局域拟合（默认 ``LOCFIT``\\ ）"

msgid "``LOCORB`` If positive, use localized orbitals in DF-HF (default 1)"
msgstr "``LOCORB`` 若为正数，在 DF-HF 中使用定域轨道（默认 1）"

msgid ""
"``LOCTRA`` If positive, use local screening in first half transformation "
"(default ``LOCFIT``)."
msgstr "``LOCTRA`` 若为正数，在前半变换中使用局域筛选（默认 ``LOCFIT``\\ ）。"

msgid "``DSCREEN`` If positive, enable density screening in LMP2 (default 0)"
msgstr "``DSCREEN`` 若为正数，在 LMP2 中启用密度筛选（默认 0）"

msgid ""
"``KSCREEN`` If positive, enable fit-basis Schwarz screening in LMP2 (default"
" depends on ``LOCTRA``)."
msgstr "``KSCREEN`` 若为正数，在 LMP2 中启用拟合基 Schwarz 筛选（默认取决于 ``LOCTRA``\\ ）。"

msgid "Parameters for fitting domains"
msgstr "拟合域参数"

msgid ""
"``THRCHG_SCF`` Parameter to select the primary orbital domains in local "
"exchange fitting (default 0.1). All atoms are included which have Löwdin "
"charges greater than this value. The primary domains are extended according "
"to ``RDOMAUX_SCF`` or ``IDOMAUX_SCF``."
msgstr ""
"``THRCHG_SCF`` 用于在局域交换拟合中选择主轨道域的参数（默认值 0.1）。所有 Löwdin 电荷大于此值的原子都将被包含在内。主域根据 "
"``RDOMAUX_SCF`` 或 ``IDOMAUX_SCF`` 进行扩展。"

msgid ""
"``FITDOM_MP2`` Parameter to select primary fitting domains in LMP2 "
"transformation (default 3). 1: use orbital domains; 2: use united orbital "
"domains of strong pairs; 3: use united orbital domains of strong and weak "
"pairs (default 3). The primary domains are extended according to "
"``RDOMAUX_MP2`` or ``IDOMAUX_MP2``"
msgstr ""
"``FITDOM_MP2`` 用于在 LMP2 变换中选择主拟合域的参数（默认值 "
"3）。1：使用轨道域；2：使用强对的联合轨道域；3：使用强对和弱对的联合轨道域（默认值 3）。主域根据 ``RDOMAUX_MP2`` 或 "
"``IDOMAUX_MP2`` 进行扩展。"

msgid ""
"``FITDOM_CCSD`` Similar to ``FITDOM_MP2`` but used for LCCSD 2-ext "
"transformation."
msgstr "``FITDOM_CCSD`` 类似于 ``FITDOM_MP2``\\ ，但用于 LCCSD 2-ext 变换。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMAUX_SCF`` Distance criterion for fitting domain extension in SCF "
"(default 5.0)"
msgstr "``RDOMAUX_SCF`` SCF 中拟合域扩展的距离判据（默认值 5.0）。"

msgid ""
"``IDOMAUX_SCF`` Connectivity criterion for fitting domain extension in SCF "
"(default 0)"
msgstr "``IDOMAUX_SCF`` SCF 中拟合域扩展的连通性判据（默认值 0）。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMAUX_CORE`` Distance criterion for core orbital fitting domain "
"extension in SCF (default ``RDOMAUX_SCF``)."
msgstr "``RDOMAUX_CORE`` SCF 中芯轨道拟合域扩展的距离判据（默认值 ``RDOMAUX_SCF``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``IDOMAUX_CORE`` Connectivity criterion for core orbital fitting domain "
"extension in SCF (default ``IDOMAUX_SCF``)."
msgstr "``IDOMAUX_CORE`` SCF 中芯轨道拟合域扩展的连通性判据（默认值 ``IDOMAUX_SCF``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMSCF_START`` Distance criterion for fitting domain extension in the "
"initial SCF iterations (default 3.0)."
msgstr "``RDOMSCF_START`` 初始 SCF 迭代中拟合域扩展的距离判据（默认值 3.0）。"

msgid ""
"``IDOMSCF_START`` Connectivity criterion for fitting domain extension in the"
" initial SCF iterations (default 1)."
msgstr "``IDOMSCF_START`` 初始 SCF 迭代中拟合域扩展的连通性判据（默认值 1）。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMSCF_FINAL`` Distance criterion for fitting domain extension in the "
"final SCF iterations (default ``RDOMAUX_SCF``)."
msgstr "``RDOMSCF_FINAL`` 最终 SCF 迭代中拟合域扩展的距离判据（默认值 ``RDOMAUX_SCF``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``IDOMSCF_FINAL`` Connectivity criterion for fitting domain extension in the"
" final SCF iterations (default ``IDOMAUX_SCF``)."
msgstr "``IDOMSCF_FINAL`` 最终 SCF 迭代中拟合域扩展的连通性判据（默认值 ``IDOMAUX_SCF``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMAUX_MP2`` Distance criterion for fitting domain extension in LMP2. The"
" default value depends on ``FITDOM_MP2``"
msgstr "``RDOMAUX_MP2`` LMP2 中拟合域扩展的距离判据。默认值取决于 ``FITDOM_MP2``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``IDOMAUX_MP2`` Connectivity criterion for fitting domain extension in LMP2."
" The default value depends on ``FITDOM_MP2``"
msgstr "``IDOMAUX_MP2`` LMP2 中拟合域扩展的连通性判据。默认值取决于 ``FITDOM_MP2``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMAUX_CCSD`` Distance criterion for fitting domain extension in LCCSD. "
"The default value depends on ``FITDOM_CCSD``)."
msgstr "``RDOMAUX_CCSD`` LCCSD 中拟合域扩展的距离判据。默认值取决于 ``FITDOM_CCSD``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``IDOMAUX_CCSD`` Connectivity criterion for fitting domain extension in "
"LCCSD. The default value depends on ``FITDOM_CCSD``."
msgstr "``IDOMAUX_CCSD`` LCCSD 中拟合域扩展的连通性判据。默认值取决于 ``FITDOM_CCSD``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMAUX_CPHF`` Distance criterion for fitting domain extension in CPHF "
"(default 3.0)."
msgstr "``RDOMAUX_CPHF`` CPHF 中拟合域扩展的距离判据（默认值 3.0）。"

msgid ""
"``RDOMAUX_SCFGRD`` Distance criterion for fitting domain extension in "
"gradients (default 5.0)."
msgstr "``RDOMAUX_SCFGRD`` 梯度中拟合域扩展的距离判据（默认值 5.0）。"

msgid "Miscellaneous control options"
msgstr "杂项控制选项"

msgid ""
"There is a rather large number of parameters. Many of these should normally "
"not be changed, and therefore only a subset is described here. A full list "
"can be obtained using"
msgstr "参数数量相当多。其中许多通常不应更改，因此这里仅描述一个子集。完整列表可通过以下方式获取："

msgid "``HELP,CFIT``"
msgstr "``HELP,CFIT``"

msgid ""
"Orbital basis sets can be chosen using type ``ORBITAL`` (but this is not "
"recommended normally!). Contraction/uncontraction can be forced appending "
"(CONTRACT) or (UNCONTRACT) to the basis name, e.g. "
"``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL.\\\\`` If other options are given in "
"parenthesis, these can be separated by commas, e.g. "
"``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d,UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL.\\\\`` Alternative forms, which "
"should work as well, are ``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL\\\\`` or "
"``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)/ORBITAL(UNCONTRACT).\\\\`` Note that the "
"CONTRACT/UNCONTRACT option cannot be used with basis set names previously "
"defined in a basis block (see below)."
msgstr ""
"可以使用类型 ``ORBITAL`` "
"选择轨道基组（但通常不建议这样做！）。可以通过在基组名称后附加（CONTRACT）或（UNCONTRACT）来强制收缩/非收缩，例如 "
"``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL.\\\\``\\ 。如果括号中给出了其他选项，这些选项可以用逗号分隔，例如 "
"``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d,UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL.\\\\``\\ 。同样可用的替代形式有 "
"``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)(UNCONTRACT)/ORBITAL\\\\`` 或 "
"``DF_BASIS=AVQZ(f/d)/ORBITAL(UNCONTRACT).\\\\``\\ 。注意，CONTRACT/UNCONTRACT "
"选项不能与先前在基组块中定义的基组名称一起使用（见下文）。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, fitting basis sets can be defined in a preceding basis block "
"(see :doc:`basis input <basis_input>`), and then be referred to with their "
"set names, e.g.,"
msgstr "或者，可以在前面的基组块中定义拟合基组（参见 :doc:`基组输入 <basis_input>`\\ ），然后用它们的集名称引用，例如，"

msgid "``DF-HF, DF_BASIS=MYJKBASIS\\\\`` ``DF-MP2, DF_BASIS=MYMP2BASIS``"
msgstr "``DF-HF, DF_BASIS=MYJKBASIS\\\\`` ``DF-MP2, DF_BASIS=MYMP2BASIS``"

msgid ""
"Further options, as fully described in section `options for density fitting "
"<density_fitting.html#options-for-density-fitting>`__, can be added on the "
"command line. In this case they are valid only for the current command. "
"Alternatively, the options can be specified on a separate ``DFIT`` "
"directive. If this is given within a command block, the options are used "
"only for the current program; this is entirely equivalent to the case that "
"the options are specified on the command line. However, if a ``DFIT`` (or "
"``GDFIT``) directive is given outside of a command block, the specified "
"options are used globally in all subsequent density fitting calculations in "
"the same run."
msgstr ""
"更多选项（如 `密度拟合选项 <density_fitting.html#options-for-density-fitting>`__ "
"一节中完整描述）可以添加到命令行。在这种情况下，它们仅对当前命令有效。或者，可以在单独的 ``DFIT`` "
"指令中指定这些选项。如果该指令在命令块内给出，选项仅用于当前程序；这与在命令行上指定选项的情况完全等效。然而，如果 ``DFIT``\\ （或 "
"``GDFIT``\\ ）指令在命令块之外给出，指定的选项将在同一次运行中的所有后续密度拟合计算中全局使用。"

msgid "``HELP,CFIT,ALIASES.``"
msgstr "``HELP,CFIT,ALIASES.``"

msgid ""
"Analogous thresholds for specific programs can be set by appending the above"
" keywords by the following specifications"
msgstr "特定程序的类似阈值可以通过在上述关键词后附加以下规范来设置"

msgid "``THRAO_FOCK`` Threshold for Coulomb fitting in DF-KS"
msgstr "``THRAO_FOCK`` DF-KS 中库仑拟合的阈值"

msgid "``(default MIN(THRAO_SCF*1.d-2,1.d-12))``"
msgstr "``(default MIN(THRAO_SCF*1.d-2,1.d-12))``"

msgid ""
"The following options can be used to modify the domains used in local "
"fitting. These parameters only have an effect if ``LOCFIT``\\ =1. The local "
"fitting domains are determined in two steps: first *primary* orbital domains"
" are determined. In the LMP2 and LCCSD programs, the primary orbital domains"
" are the same as used for excitation domains and determined by the Boughton-"
"Pulay procedure, as described in Sect. :doc:`PAO-based local correlation "
"treatments <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments>`. Depending on the value"
" of ``FITDOM_MP2`` or ``FITDOM_CCSD`` for LMP2 and LCCSD, respectively, "
"either the orbital domains are used directly or united pair domains are "
"generated. In DF-HF the primary orbital domains include all basis functions "
"at atoms which have Löwdin charges greater or equal to ``THRCHG_SCF``. In "
"the second step the primary fitting domains are extended using either "
"distance criteria (``RDOMAUX``, in bohr) or bond connectivity criteria "
"(``IDOMAUX``). ``IDOMAUX``\\ =1 means to include all functions at atoms "
"which are at most one bond distant from the primary domains. By default, "
"distance criteria are used. However, if ``IDOMAUX``.ge.0, the distance "
"criteria are ignored and connectivity is used."
msgstr ""
"以下选项可用于修改局域拟合中使用的域。这些参数仅在 ``LOCFIT``\\ =1 时才有效。局域拟合域分两步确定：首先确定\\ *主*\\ 轨道域。在"
" LMP2 和 LCCSD 程序中，主轨道域与激发域相同，由 Boughton-Pulay 过程确定，如 :doc:`基于 PAO 的局域相关处理 "
"<pao-based_local_correlation_treatments>` 一节所述。根据 LMP2 和 LCCSD 中 "
"``FITDOM_MP2`` 或 ``FITDOM_CCSD`` 的值，可以要么直接使用轨道域，要么生成联合对域。在 DF-HF 中，主轨道域包括 "
"Löwdin 电荷大于或等于 ``THRCHG_SCF`` 的原子的所有基函数。第二步，使用距离标准（\\ ``RDOMAUX``\\ ，单位为 "
"bohr）或成键连接性标准（\\ ``IDOMAUX``\\ ）扩展主拟合域。\\ ``IDOMAUX``\\ =1 "
"表示包括与主域至多一个键距离的原子的所有函数。默认使用距离标准。然而，如果 ``IDOMAUX``.ge.0，则忽略距离标准并使用连接性。"

msgid ""
"``SCSGRD`` Switches the DF-LMP2 analytic gradient to Grimme's SCS scaled MP2"
" energy functional (default 0)."
msgstr "``SCSGRD`` 将 DF-LMP2 解析梯度切换为 Grimme 的 SCS 标度 MP2 能量泛函（默认 0）。"
